message: "If you use this skill, please cite it as below."
title: "Brazilian Fiscal Data (SICONFI) for Research Pipelines"
abstract: >-
  Query state and municipal fiscal accounts from SICONFI by IBGE code, normalise field spellings
  across demonstratives and aggregate by account prefix so that every total can be re-checked by a
  reader.
type: software
